Subject: [PATCH 2059/3799] soh: rename D_80AB8604 -> sSwayTargets

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the two alternating targets, +/-5000, that unk_26C[9] approaches while the cucco stands still; the limb that field drives is not established
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
index a786a777a..6161d87de 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
@@ -66,7 +66,8 @@ const ActorInit En_Niw_InitVars = {
     (ActorResetFunc)EnNiw_Reset,
 };
 
-static f32 D_80AB8604[] = {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_80AB8604: the two alternating targets, +/-5000, that unk_26C[9] approaches while the cucco stands still; the limb that field drives is not established
+static f32 sSwayTargets[] = {  // was D_80AB8604 [LLM:GUESS]
     5000.0f,
     -5000.0f,
 };
@@ -535,7 +536,7 @@ void EnNiw_Idle(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
             this->unk_2E6++;
             this->unk_2E6 &= 1;
         }
-        Math_ApproachF(&this->unk_26C[9], D_80AB8604[this->unk_2E6], 0.5f, 4000.0f);
+        Math_ApproachF(&this->unk_26C[9], sSwayTargets[this->unk_2E6], 0.5f, 4000.0f);  // was D_80AB8604 [LLM:GUESS]
     }
 
     if (this->timer5 == 0 && this->timer4 == 0) {
